When we create a project in Anndroid Studio, it will create a MainActivity.kt automatically.
Activy is a component for one or more screen inn our apps and the unit user innteract with. The activity Lifecycle states are:
onCreate()- state when the activity is created.
onStart()- state when the activity is opened/started.
onResume()- state for when the activity has returned after being paused.
onPause()- state when the activity is inn view but not active.
onStop()- state when activity is runnning in the Background.
onDestroy()- state when activity is closed.

onStop() and onPause() have similar use but onPause is used when the activity is still in view.
syntax:
